(property "Description" " | verified | SOIC28, no exposed pad. Address pins hard-strapped; 100nF +10uF close to VDD.; Set IOCON.ODR=1 and MIRROR=1 before enabling interrupts; no push-pull interrupt wire-OR. Program OLAT safe-low before IODIR outputs.; Unused outputs unconnected; firmware sets low. GPA7/GPB7 never configured as inputs.; Active-low RESET pin18 joins shared E3_MCP_RESET_N. Pico GP17 controls its open-drain Q306. Retain this chip10k pullup to3V3_Q6A; no pullup toPico3V3/AON.; DS20001952D table1-2 specifies output highimpedance within1us of RESETlow; reset IODIR=0xff, OLAT=0.00, GPINTEN=0. Initialize IO7 output bits to0 only after writing safeOLAT0; do not attempt to read GPA7/GPB7 as inputs." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
