(text "UM3304 UART7/PPS/SWD cable capacitance and power-off behavior cannot be proven by ERC.\nВорота (стенд): Check <=20cm wiring, UART7 loopback, boot glitches and absence of Q6A backfeed with Pico\non/Q6A off. Verify TX high-impedance sequencing or add hardware isolation." (at 334.01 244.67 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid e7b0d5e6-c714-5366-ba5a-efbe6f4be9e0))
